            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swiftly meldet an Trakt, was du schaust. Ab 80 Prozent steht der Titel dort als gesehen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swiftly tells Trakt what you watch. From 80 percent on, the title shows up there as watched."
          }
        },
